# Precise Redaction: "Counter target white or black spell." On turn 3 Bot1 casts Ornithopter, a colorless artifact spell:
# Precise Redaction cannot target it (the refusal). Then Bot1's black Dark Ritual and white Enlightened Tutor are each
# countered by one - the black half and the white half of the target - so neither resolves (no mana, no search) and both,
# with the Redactions, end in the graveyards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Enlightened Tutor
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Precise Redaction
Precise Redaction
Island x10

